  ],
  "verificationNotes": "Owner authorized publication-first testing through the normal Supernala UI. The admitted catalog remains documentation-derived, not a consented tools/list capture. notion-fetch with id self returns a text block containing JSON whose self object carries workspace, user, and current_tool_access. The MCP-audience token is not sent to public REST /v1/users/me. Initial user_id/workspace_id/email_domain token fields must survive refreshes that omit them. Live consent, hosted catalog equality, per-plan tool eligibility, privacy review, and production acceptance remain pending and must not be inferred from reviewed-publishable status."
}
